<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
  <head>
    <meta content="text/html; charset=UTF-8" http-equiv="Content-Type" />
    <title>Payment Successful</title>
    <style>
      body { font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background: #f9f9f9; color: #333; }
      .container { max-width: 600px; margin: 40px auto; background: #fff; padding: 30px; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);}
      .header { font-size: 24px; font-weight: bold; color: #27ae60; margin-bottom: 20px; }
      .details { margin: 20px 0; }
      .footer { margin-top: 30px; font-size: 14px; color: #888; }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="container">
      <div class="header">Payment Successful!</div>
      <p>Dear <%= @user.full_name %>,</p>
      <p>Thank you for your payment. Your transaction has been processed successfully.</p>
      <div class="details">
        <strong>Payment Details:</strong>
        <ul>
          <li>Amount: <%= number_to_currency(@payment.order.total_price) %></li>
          <li>Date: <%= @payment.created_at.strftime("%B %d, %Y") %></li>
          <li>Payment method: <%= PaymentMethod::method_name(@payment.payment_method) %></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <p>If you have any questions, feel free to contact our support team.</p>
      <div class="footer">
        &copy; <%= Time.current.year %> Your Company Name. All rights reserved.
      </div>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>